<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px; color: #1a1a1a;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #c2410c;">Your payment is still failing</h1>
    <p>Hi{{#if recipient_name}} {{recipient_name}}{{/if}},</p>
    <p>We've tried a few times to charge <strong>{{amount_display}}</strong> for your Growth Project subscription and the bank keeps declining. You're still in the program for now, but if we can't collect this payment soon your access will be paused.</p>
    <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="{{billing_portal_url}}" style="display: inline-block; background: #c2410c; color: #fff; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">Update payment now</a>
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;">The most common fix is a new card number or a fresh expiration date — both take about thirty seconds in the portal.</p>
    {{#if cancellation_date}}
    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;">If payment isn't received by <strong>{{cancellation_date}}</strong>, your subscription will be canceled.</p>
    {{/if}}
    <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea; margin: 32px 0;" />
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888;">Need help? Just reply — we'll figure it out together.</p>
  </body>
</html>
